# Vite loads this file for `vite dev` (mode "development") only, never for a
# build. Translate mode and discovery on a developer machine: the dev server
# answers the translate endpoint and writes public/locales/. Explicit
# configuration, on purpose — the app never derives the mode from DEV. Holds
# nothing secret and nothing a build should see; a shell variable wins over it.
VITE_TRANSLATE_MODE=dev
